+*   **Correction Factor:** A scalar multiplier applied to the covariance matrices to adjust the effective spread. Value: $1.38$ [S1].
+*   **Ellipse Bounds:** The 2D ellipse metric is clamped/culled between $0$ and $9$ [S1].
